    "info_set": "ret_t, log RV_t, log RV_w(5), log RV_m(22), log VIX^2 \u2014 identical for NN windows and GARCH-X/HAR-X baselines",
    "target_note": "rv_cc (close-to-close r^2) is a very noisy proxy on which classical GARCH wins by construction and the paper's HAR>>GARCH ranking does NOT hold; the paper's claim is on a SMOOTH RV target (range-based), so rv_park is the faithful-reproduction target."
  },
